// Potential Startup Shortcut Persistence Via PowerShell.EXE | T1547.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_powershell_startup_shortcuts.yml
DeviceFileEvents
| where (InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\powershell.exe" or InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\pwsh.exe") and FolderPath contains "\\start menu\\programs\\startup\\" and FolderPath endswith ".lnk"
